403:{character:player} Darn you're just... Awesome. Really. You're so cool with the way you do things, Joseph!
405:{character:player} That's no exaggeration, not at all! Those treasures represent your achievements, your glory, yet you feel they are a burden, preventing your progress. So you give them away! Doesn't such an attitude to life deserve to be called "awesome"?!
406:{character:Joseph} Hahaha! What's up with you, friend? I've never seen you so excited before. Even if it is a compliment, isn't it a little too much?
407:{character:player} YOU'RE AWESOME, for real... I'm not joking, Joseph. I really admire you. You have shown me the soul of a man who truly lives for adventure.
408:{character:player} A toast! A toast to your generosity and sincerity, Joseph!
409:{character:Joseph} My friend, you... I'm a little flustered by your praise! I swear I must be blushing bright red! Cheers!
410:{character:player} That's because you've had too much to drink! But who cares about the details! Cheers!
411:{character:player} But Joseph... You'd better not treat our friendship the same as your treasures.
412:{character:Joseph} What? What nonsense is this, friend? I would never do such a thing.
